Subject: [PATCH] new(infra): Add sandbox infrastructure for AI agents and fast
 dev setup

Implements a 4-phase plan for Sentry development sandboxes:

Phase 1 - Pre-built image pipeline:
- Dockerfile.agent: Python .venv + Node node_modules + codebase
- Dockerfile.postgres: Pre-migrated Postgres with all 4 databases
- CI workflow for nightly + on-change builds to GHCR
- Content-hash cache keys for idempotent rebuilds

Phase 2 - Agent sandbox runtime:
- Docker Compose with agent + postgres + redis sidecars
- Sentry config tuned for sandbox environments
- Resource limits and security constraints

Phase 3 - Agent harness SDK:
- Python SDK with Sandbox.create/exec/destroy lifecycle
- CLI wrapper (sentry-sandbox create/exec/run/destroy)
- Source-to-test file mapping heuristics

Phase 4 - Developer environments:
- devcontainer.json for GitHub Codespaces
- fast-setup.sh for restoring from pre-built images
- Delta migration support for slightly-stale images

